      "id": "claim_bef0a8d5215f483d9610d2021575dea4",
      "statement": "graph.py:start is the conditional function attached to the START edge; it routes to \"research\" when state.report is already set (a follow-up in an existing thread) and to \"gdelt\" otherwise (a new run), making State.report the sole signal distinguishing a follow-up from a new run.",
