    {
      "id": "claim_ef026166bdd14926a86e14ab67548aea",
      "statement": "state.py:State is a single Pydantic model shared by all graph nodes; each documented field is written by exactly one owning node (as_of/stories by gdelt, severe/jev_status by triage, findings/sources by research, rejected/verify_status by verify, moves/price_window by price, report/messages by output), and nodes return partial dicts that LangGraph merges into the running state.",
