    {
      "id": "claim_2a33826eae024e0fa1c63dd6cfe0afc3",
      "statement": "graph.py exposes two differently-persisted compiled graphs from the same builder: the module-level `graph` (build().compile() with no checkpointer/store, used by langgraph dev/Studio, which supplies its own persistence) versus the app main.py builds (build().compile(checkpointer=saver, store=store) backed by data/threads.db), so Studio threads/memory are isolated from the CLI's persisted threads.",
